<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>HZDS - Movement for a Democratic Slovakia</p>
<p>ZRS  - Workers Party</p>
<p>SNS  - Slovak National Party</p>
<p>IND  - Independent</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor..........................Vladimir MASAR</p>
